Web-only, applied by build-web.sh and reverted after the build.
A just-published note goes live on the worker's next cron tick (up to a minute), after the map has
already fetched, so it only showed up after a reload or a pan. The web map now polls its view every
15 s and updates only when the set of notes changed.

